        <ns1:HEIRO_2000028>2023-09-25</ns1:HEIRO_2000028>
        <ns2:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">The file read is a revised issue of the 2023 framework. Its cover keeps the date of 25 September 2023, and it states changes made on 23 January 2025, in June 2025 and in July 2026, which HEIRO records as listed amendments of this version. Sections 3.6 and 3.9 are not among the changes it lists.</ns2:IAO_0000116>
