        <ns2:IAO_0000116 xml:lang="en">HAS dates the guide by its posting on 29 July 2020. The PDF says it was validated by the CEESP on 6 April 2020, and the page names the College decision of 2 July 2020 adopting it. The English PDF is a translation. The page also says it was updated on 8 July 2026, and HEIRO did not compare the French PDF of today with an earlier copy, so whether the guide itself changed is not known.</ns2:IAO_0000116>
