        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000188"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_9000005"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_0000094"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The figure this rule states is a HEAO adopted threshold value, so a valuation that applies it can be typed by HEAO.</rdfs:comment>
        <ns3:HEAO_9000001 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_4000001"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000189 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000189">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_0000010"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000004 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000148"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000005 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://www.nice.org.uk/process/pmg36/chapter/committee-recommendations-2#pmg36-6_3_7</ns1:HEIRO_2000005>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000006>6.3.7</ns1:HEIRO_2000006>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000007>As the ICER for a technology increases in the range of £25,000 to £35,000 per QALY gained, the committee&apos;s decisions about the acceptability of the technology as an effective use of NHS resources will make explicit reference to the relevant factors listed in section 6.3.5.</ns1:HEIRO_2000007>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/heiro-register.owl"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PMG36 section 6.3.7, version of 13 October 2026</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000190 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000190">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_0000010"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000004 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000148"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000005 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#anyURI">https://www.nice.org.uk/process/pmg36/chapter/committee-recommendations-2#pmg36-6_3_8</ns1:HEIRO_2000005>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000006>6.3.8</ns1:HEIRO_2000006>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000007>Above a most plausible ICER of £35,000 per QALY gained or £100,000 per QALY gained for highly specialised technologies, the committee will need to identify an increasingly stronger case for supporting the technology as an effective use of NHS resources, considering the factors listed in sections 6.3.5 and 6.3.6.</ns1:HEIRO_2000007>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/heiro-register.owl"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">PMG36 section 6.3.8, version of 13 October 2026</rdfs:label>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    


    <!-- https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000191 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000191">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_0000011"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/rheo/RHEO_0000117"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000187"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000203"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000219"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000256"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000015 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000001"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000013>Highly specialised technologies. The size of benefit QALY weight of up to 3 is judged against this level (sections 6.2.22 to 6.2.24)</ns1:HEIRO_2000013>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000028>2022-01-31</ns1:HEIRO_2000028>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000030>2022-01-31</ns1:HEIRO_2000030>
        <ns4:RHEO_2000001 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">100000.0</ns4:RHEO_2000001>
        <ns4:RHEO_2000002>GBP per QALY gained</ns4:RHEO_2000002>
        <ns4:RHEO_2000003>GBP</ns4:RHEO_2000003>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Stated in PMG36, in the versions of 31 January 2022, 17 December 2025, 31 March 2026, 13 October 2026.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/heiro-register.owl"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">NICE level of 100,000 pounds per QALY gained for highly specialised technologies</rdfs:label>
        <ns1:HEIRO_9000004 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/HEMO_5000196"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_9000004 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/HEMO_5000213"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_9000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_0000094"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000191"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_9000004"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/HEMO_5000196"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The HEMO formula Incremental net monetary benefit takes the figures of this rule as inputs, since HEMO keeps policy figures out of its formulas.</rdfs:comment>
        <ns3:HEAO_9000001 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_4000003"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000191"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_9000004"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/HEMO_5000213"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The HEMO formula Incremental net health benefit at threshold k takes the figures of this rule as inputs, since HEMO keeps policy figures out of its formulas.</rdfs:comment>
        <ns3:HEAO_9000001 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_4000003"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000191"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_9000005"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_0000094"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The figure this rule states is a HEAO adopted threshold value, so a valuation that applies it can be typed by HEAO.</rdfs:comment>
        <ns3:HEAO_9000001 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_4000001"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    


    <!-- https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000192 -->

    <owl:NamedIndividual rdf:about="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000192">
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000033"/>
        <rdf:type rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_0000011"/>
        <ns3:HEAO_1000026 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000265"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000193"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000257"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_1000015 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000001"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000013>When decision-making modifiers are applied, net health benefits are presented at both values, with and without the QALY weighting</ns1:HEIRO_2000013>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000028>2026-03-31</ns1:HEIRO_2000028>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000030>2026-03-31</ns1:HEIRO_2000030>
        <ns4:RHEO_2000001 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">25000.0</ns4:RHEO_2000001>
        <ns4:RHEO_2000001 rdf:datatype="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#decimal">35000.0</ns4:RHEO_2000001>
        <ns4:RHEO_2000002>GBP per QALY gained</ns4:RHEO_2000002>
        <ns4:RHEO_2000003>GBP</ns4:RHEO_2000003>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">Stated in PMG36, in the versions of 31 March 2026, 13 October 2026.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:isDefinedBy rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/heiro-register.owl"/>
        <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">NICE rule that net health benefits are presented at 25,000 and 35,000 pounds per QALY</rdfs:label>
        <ns1:HEIRO_9000004 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/HEMO_5000968"/>
        <ns1:HEIRO_9000005 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_0000094"/>
    </owl:NamedIndividual>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000192"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_1000026"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000265"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The version of 31 March 2026 replaced the threshold values of the version of 17 December 2025, as its update information says.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000192"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_1000026"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000265"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The version of 31 March 2026 replaced the threshold values of the version of 17 December 2025, as its update information says.</rdfs:comment>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000192"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_9000004"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/hemo/HEMO_5000968"/>
        <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The HEMO formula QALY-weighted incremental net health benefit takes the figures of this rule as inputs, since HEMO keeps policy figures out of its formulas.</rdfs:comment>
        <ns3:HEAO_9000001 rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_4000003"/>
    </owl:Axiom>
    <owl:Axiom>
        <owl:annotatedSource rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_5000192"/>
        <owl:annotatedProperty rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heiro/HEIRO_9000005"/>
        <owl:annotatedTarget rdf:resource="https://healtheconomics.wiki/ontologies/heao/HEAO_0000094"/>
