        <ns1:HEIRO_2000006>Guideline 7</ns1:HEIRO_2000006>
        <ns1:HEIRO_2000007>the public discount rate applicable at the time of the evaluation (set at 2.5% at the time of publication of this guidance)</ns1:HEIRO_2000007>
